{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:45:654","content":{"id":654,"title":"折线","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"绘制折线我们可以使用多个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<line>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签，但是这样会有点麻烦，我们可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<polyline>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 标签，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"points","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定点的坐标即可"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\">\n  <polyline\n    points=\"20 160, 80 100, 140 70, 200 80, 260 10, 320 40, 380 50\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"5\"\n  />\n</svg>","language":"html","uuid":"2a6c3de7-65fb-4013-88cf-061f08d7b195","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<svg width=\"400\" height=\"200\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 200\">\n  <polyline\n    points=\"20 160, 80 100, 140 70, 200 80, 260 10, 320 40, 380 50\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"5\"\n  />\n</svg>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"green","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"绘制折线最好将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"fill","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"none","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，否则会被默认填充为黑色。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"之前用来设置线的属性均可用来设置折线，另外折线还有一个特别的属性 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"stroke-linejoin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，用来设置线连接处的形状，有三种取值："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"meter","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：尖状，默认值"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"round","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：圆形"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"bevel","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：平"}]}]}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<svg width=\"200\" height=\"40\">\n  <polyline\n    points=\"30 30, 45 15, 60 30\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"12\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke-linejoin=\"miter\"\n  />\n  <polyline\n    points=\"90 30, 105 15, 120 30\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"12\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n  />\n  <polyline\n    points=\"150 30, 165 15, 180 30\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"12\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke-linejoin=\"bevel\"\n  />\n</svg>","language":"html","uuid":"e0f1746e-0fa8-4afa-b23f-2173def4fe31","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<svg width=\"200\" height=\"40\">\n  <polyline\n    points=\"30 30, 45 15, 60 30\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"12\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke-linejoin=\"miter\"\n  />\n  <polyline\n    points=\"90 30, 105 15, 120 30\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"12\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n  />\n  <polyline\n    points=\"150 30, 165 15, 180 30\"\n    stroke=\"gray\"\n    stroke-width=\"12\"\n    fill=\"none\"\n    stroke-linejoin=\"bevel\"\n  />\n</svg>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"SVG","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"基本概念","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:648","type":"doc","id":648}},{"label":"基本形状","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:652","type":"doc","id":652}},{"label":"折线","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:654","type":"doc","id":654}}],"prevPage":{"title":"线","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:653","type":"doc","id":653}},"nextPage":{"title":"矩形","target":{"key":"doc:project:45:655","type":"doc","id":655}},"createTime":1703605450892,"updateTime":1743303640565,"projectId":45},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640565},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"formatVersion":1,"id":"